  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced almonds and cook until toasted, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped rocket and cook until wilted, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with additional chopped rocket and toasted almonds if desired."
